"include but are not limited to giving saved searches access to previously"
" inaccessible data or making previously available knowledge objects "
"unavailable. Review your knowledge objects before you reassign them, and "
"confirm that the user you logged in with holds a Splunk role with the "
"'list_all_users' capability to reassign this knowledge object to any "
"other user."
