"If enabled, this lookup will only be visible to and modifiable by the "
"user who created it."
msgstr ""
"Se abilitata, questa lookup sarà visibile e modificabile solo dall'utente "
"che l'ha creata."

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/packages/modern-nav/src/HealthModal/InfoBox/InfoBoxBad/component.tsx:58 
